UID:6a9709cc69166f088b967d98@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Folk and fairytale from different traditions are re-told with 
 hand puppets\, live music and humour in a fun\, interactive performance by
  puppeteer Hugh Phillips. He will be performing The Three Little Pigs. The
  classic fairytale told with fresh twists and humour.\n"There's a wolf in 
 this story? No one told me that! I would have never signed up for this!"\n
 Drop-in.\nUnfortunately\, we cannot accommodate any large groups/daycares 
 for this program.\nLive or automated closed captioning\, sign language int
 erpretation\, intervenor services\, or attendant services are available up
 on request. Please submit your request at least 2 weeks in advance to: tpl
 .ca/accessibility-events.
