BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mothercraft Drop in by EarlyON
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261102T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261102T123000
UID:6a873d9b58433600542ab735@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Mothercraft Drop-In\, for   children aged 0-6 and 
 their caregivers\, where participants will engage with   early-years profe
 ssionals\, and connect with others in the community. Through   a variety o
 f fun activities\, books\, songs\, and play\, this program aims to   help 
 strengthen adult-child relationships\, support parent education\, and   fo
 ster healthy child development.
LOCATION:Oakwood Village Library and Arts Centre\, Auditorium
