BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Family Movies - The Super Mario Galaxy Movie
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261003T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261003T130000
UID:6a6e45bce9de6536001fcf41@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Every other Saturday Cliffcrest will be screening a free famil
 y friendly movie!\nThis months' movie:\nThe Super Mario Galaxy Movie\nThe 
 Super Mario Galaxy Movie finds Mario and Luigi solving everyday problems i
 n the Mushroom Kingdom with their 'let's-a-go' attitude. They meet a new f
 riend in Yoshi\, try to reform a miniaturized Bowser\, and eagerly look fo
 rward to Peach's birthday party. A call for help sends the crew across the
  galaxy to face new worlds\, unexpected threats\, and iconic characters li
 ke Rosalina and Bowser Jr.
LOCATION:Cliffcrest
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a6e45bce9de6536001fcf41
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
